{"abstract":"We present a Research through Design exploration of the potential for using tangible and embodied interactions to enable active music experiences - musicking - for non-musicians. We present the Tubularium prototype, which aims to facilitate music-making to non-musicians by not requiring any initial skill while still eliciting agency and overall, providing a meaningful experience. We present the design of the prototype and the features implemented and reflect on insights from a public event in which the prototype was trialed.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Montesinos, Lucía","Jensen, Halfdan Hauch","Løvlie, Anders Sundnes"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-818255"],"event":{"acronym":"NIME","end":"2025-06-27","place":"Canberra, au","start":"2025-06-24","title":"International Conference on New Interfaces for Musical Expression","year":"2025"},"filters":{"added":"2025-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Embodied interaction","Musicking","Non Musicians","Research through Design","Tangible interaction"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"enabling embodied music making for non musicians","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15699662","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-818255","identifier":[{"id":"105010843977","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-f4b27c41-80c3-4a4f-aa9b-41866214f073"],"keyword":["Embodied Interaction","Musicking","Non-Musicians","Research through Design","Tangible Interaction"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-3A6964F02285C03B092FBC3AF383CD4B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5