{"abstract":"This paper presents a Research through Design exploration of the potential for using tangible interactions to enable active music experiences - musicking - for non-musicians. We present the Tubularium prototype, which aims to help non-musicians play music without requiring any initial skill. We present the initial design of the prototype and the features implemented in order to enable music-making by non-musicians, and offer some reflections based on observations of informal initial user explorations of the prototype.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Montesinos, Lucía","Løvlie, Anders Sundnes","Jensen, Halfdan Hauch"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-747259"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Music","Musicking","Research through Design","Tangible interactions"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"using tangible interaction to design musicking artifacts for non musicians","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dpr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2404.09597.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-747259","ids":["itu-b7531ccc-7d89-43cd-b9ea-63cdc1b8838c"],"keyword":["Music","Musicking","Research through Design","tangible interactions"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-01AACD3125C7F80F7B2536C2ABE3431D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2404.09597.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.09597","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"I